@startuml
title sizbiz — ecosystem value
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor "Buyer" as buyer
actor "Local business" as merchant
actor "sizbiz team" as team
rectangle "sizbiz\nlocal offers" as platform

buyer --> platform : discovers, buys,\nuses
platform --> buyer : clear terms,\nQR/PIN, support
merchant --> platform : offer,\nlocations, fulfillment
platform --> merchant : audience,\nsales and redemption records
team --> platform : preparation,\nmoderation, operations
platform --> team : statuses,\ncases, audit

note bottom of platform
Impact intention:
value for people, growth for business,
benefit for the local community
end note
@enduml
